var e=`Akukho mfuneko yokuba usethe nantoni na. Lo mfanekiso weDocker sele uqulathe kwaye ulungiselele iMariaDB ngokuzenzekelayo. I-Uptime Kuma iya kuqhagamshela kule database nge-unix socket.`,t=`Ngowuphi umthombo wedatha ofuna ukuwusebenzisa?`,n=`Qhagamshela kwi-database yeMariaDB yangaphandle. Kuya kufuneka usethe ulwazi loqhagamshelo lwedathabase.`,r=`I database elula, ecetyiswayo kusetyenziso oluncinci. Ngaphambi kwe v2.0.0, i-Uptime Kuma yayisebenzisa i-SQLite njenge database yomdibaniso.`,i=`Ukumisela i-database. Kungathatha ixesha, nceda ube nomonde.`,a={setupDatabaseEmbeddedMariaDB:e,setupDatabaseChooseDatabase:t,setupDatabaseMariaDB:n,setupDatabaseSQLite:r,settingUpDatabaseMSG:i};export{a as default,i as settingUpDatabaseMSG,t as setupDatabaseChooseDatabase,e as setupDatabaseEmbeddedMariaDB,n as setupDatabaseMariaDB,r as setupDatabaseSQLite};